SUMMARY:📢 Post #8: Interactive LinkedIn Poll — Emergency Intake Benchmarking
DESCRIPTION:LINKEDIN SCHEDULED POST: POST #8 (Day 18)\nFORMAT: Interactive LinkedIn Poll\nTOPIC: Emergency Intake Benchmarking\nATTACHED ASSET: LinkedIn Native Poll (4 Options):
1. Unmonitored Voicemail (Listen at 8 AM)
2. Traditional Answering Service (Take message)
3. Automated SMS & Safety Triage (< 10s)
4. Owner/Dispatcher Personal Cell\nTARGET GOAL: High-engagement poll; uncovers prospective contractors who struggle with after-hours dispatch.\n\nREADY-TO-PASTE COPY:\n-----------------------------------------\nWhen an emergency plumbing or HVAC call comes in at 8:30 PM\, what happens at your company?\n\nWe recently audited 25 regional service contractors and found that 68% of after-hours calls go straight to an unmonitored voicemail box\, surrendering high-ticket jobs to instant competitors.\n\nVote below to see how your operational intake compares with industry peers 👇\n\n#FieldService #Contractors #EmergencyDispatch #OperationsPoll\n-----------------------------------------\n\nPOSTING INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Copy the text above.\n2. Attach the local file if required.\n3. Publish to LinkedIn at 09:00 AM!
