SUMMARY:📢 Post #20: Interactive LinkedIn Poll — Quoting Close Rate Benchmark
DESCRIPTION:LINKEDIN SCHEDULED POST: POST #20 (Day 46)\nFORMAT: Interactive LinkedIn Poll\nTOPIC: Quoting Close Rate Benchmark\nATTACHED ASSET: LinkedIn Native Poll (4 Options):
1. Under 30% (Standard flat quoting)
2. 30% – 45% (Some follow-up)
3. 45% – 60% (Using tiered proposals)
4. Over 60% (Top-decile sales execution)\nTARGET GOAL: High-engagement poll revealing quoting efficiency across the network.\n\nREADY-TO-PASTE COPY:\n-----------------------------------------\nWhat is your firm's average close rate on major equipment replacements ($4\,000+)?\n\nAcross the contractors we audit\, close rates on single flat-price estimates average 32%. Contractors using interactive 3-tier Good/Better/Best proposals average 54%.\n\nVote below to benchmark your firm against industry averages 👇\n\n#ContractorPoll #SalesPerformance #HVACSales #PlumbingEstimates\n-----------------------------------------\n\nPOSTING INSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Copy the text above.\n2. Attach the local file if required.\n3. Publish to LinkedIn at 09:00 AM!
